        "filing_date": "2026-04-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In February 2023, we completed our initial public offering and listed our ADSs on the Nasdaq Global Select Market under the symbol “HSAI.” We raised approximately US$174.5 million in net proceeds from the issuance of new shares from the initial public offering and partial exercise of over-allotment option after deducting underwriting commissions and the other offering expenses payable by us.",
        "start_character": 2358,
        "end_character": 2752
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-048025",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-048025-4e41febe8eea02a8",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-048025",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-24",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In our ongoing efforts to maintain customer satisfaction and improve our products and services, we have a high-quality after-sales team to provide comprehensive after-sales service.",
        "start_character": 54325,
        "end_character": 54506
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-048025",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-048025-4e41febe8eea02a8",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-048025",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our initial focus was on high-performance laser sensors used in natural gas and other industries, but we shifted our primary business to the development, manufacturing and sales of LiDAR products in 2016.",
        "start_character": 302,
        "end_character": 506
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-048025",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-048025-4e41febe8eea02a8",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-048025",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Since then, we have developed and produced a full range of LiDAR solutions and products for various applications in ADAS and Robotics.",
        "start_character": 507,
        "end_character": 641
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-048025",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-048025-4e41febe8eea02a8",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-048025",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have a dedicated business development team in each of the business areas in charge of the marketing of our LiDAR products to prospective customers.",
        "start_character": 52175,
        "end_character": 52325
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-048025",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-048025-4e41febe8eea02a8",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-048025",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-24",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have a dedicated team in China and globally to provide before- and after-sales services to our customers.",
        "start_character": 54507,
        "end_character": 54615
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-048025",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-048025-4e41febe8eea02a8",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-048025",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We sell our LiDAR products primarily through direct offline sales, with only a minimal portion distributed via regional distributors and system integrators.",
        "start_character": 53205,
        "end_character": 53361
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-048025",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-048025-4e41febe8eea02a8",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-048025",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "With our long history of pioneering LiDAR products, we have cultivated in-house manufacturing and testing capabilities to maintain our high-quality control standards, optimize manufacturing cost structure, speed up the iteration of our product development cycle, and increase the robustness of our supply chain.",
        "start_character": 45154,
        "end_character": 45465
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-048025",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-048025-4e41febe8eea02a8",
